OFAC is designating the following additional entities pursuant to E.O. 13694, as further amended, for being owned or controlled by, or having acted or purported to act for or on behalf of, directly or indirectly, Rithy. Rithy is a director of each of these companies.

Aurum Co Ltd

Kaissa Travel Co Ltd

Khemreah Co Ltd

OFAC is designating the following additional entities pursuant to E.O. 13694, as further amended, for being owned or controlled by, or having acted or purported to act for or on behalf of, directly or indirectly, Aik Paung and Sai Aung Linn. Aik Paung and Sai Aung Linn are the sole directors of each of these companies.

Xiong Wei Investment Co Ltd

